		NPCs: {
			Charles: {
				DisplayName: Charles

				TownNPCMood: {
					Content: The stone swallows all noise. Only the quiet dust remains here.
					NoHome: I lack a cavern roof! The open sky lets the wind mock me. I must find stone below.
					FarFromHome: I’ve wandered too far into the sun. I need to burrow back beneath before they spot me.
					LoveSpace: Distance from villagers lets the buried voices speak through the static.
					DislikeCrowded: Too many breathing mouths and useless chatter. The crypts are far cleaner.
					HateCrowded: A swarm of cretins! This crush of bodies is eating my thoughts alive.
					LoveBiome: Blessed Ocean. Its heavy tides drown out the surface noise.
					LikeNPC_Princess: "{NPCName} is tolerable. She doesn't grind against my temper."
					Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} lingers around me. Somehow, she stomach's my gloom."
					HateBiome: Cursed Jungle. That suffocating ceiling of green is torture!
					HateNPC: "{NPCName} makes my blood boil! That shrill voice begs for silence."
					DislikeNPC: "{NPCName} and those rattling contraptions. They trigger my migraines."
					LikeNPC: "{NPCName} understands focus. No chatter, just purpose."
					LoveNPC: "{NPCName} and I share the same deep loathing for the crowd."
					DislikeBiome: Wretched Snow. The bitter frost turns my ink to sludge.
					LikeBiome: The Desert. Scorched, silent, and empty. True peace.
				}
			}

			DeepOne.DisplayName: Deep One
		}
	}
}
